# Code Architecture

`code/run.py` is the only manual run entry. `code/configs/datasets` describes datasets, `code/configs/models` describes model hyperparameters, and `code/configs/experiments` describes runnable phases.

Add a dataset in `code/datasets` + dataset YAML. Add a model in `code/models` + model YAML. Add an alignment/adaptation method in `code/methods`. Add an experiment in `code/experiments` + experiment YAML. Update the local README and `0_docs/FILE_CATALOG.md` every time.
